create_couple logic:

Create the Couple record
If location provided: create Location record, set couple.location_id
If device_ids provided: update each device's couple_id to this couple (Business Rule #1 — auto-unassign from old couple first)
If fitting_materials provided: create FittingMaterial records with this couple_id
If copy_materials_from provided: call inventory copy_materials_from_couple
If template_id provided: call inventory create_materials_from_template
Record audit
Return full CoupleResponse with nested devices, materials, location
delete_couple logic (Business Rule #3):

Soft-delete the couple (set deleted_at)
Set all devices where couple_id == this couple to couple_id = NULL
If couple has pair_id, set couple.pair_id = NULL (removes from pair)
Record audit
change_couple_location logic (Business Rule #8):

Get current couple with current location
If couple already has a location:
